    "svgcontent": "<svg width=\"1600\" height=\"960\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:svg=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:html=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><g><title>Layer 1</title><rect id=\"svg_36fd43fc-339d-46f2-9c81-5af1dd15bacc\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1600\" height=\"960\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#141c26\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_698a363a-a76a-4de0-8b99-2bc61c32324b\" x=\"20\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">MECHANISM SETUP</text><g id=\"HXB_1ea5a771-42f8-466c-951d-d1269f9a4f35\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_a4dcea79-74fb-42d6-9de4-7276b053cf8c\" x=\"1430\" y=\"16\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_a880fc33-fdd3-47da-ba8c-fe8811779d9e\" x=\"1430\" y=\"16\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_f2bde3ad-f24a-4d41-93c5-409b665af749\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Overview</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><text id=\"svg_47d5c33c-88c8-47c7-b33d-4600e7e98315\" x=\"20\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Adjust the simulated mechanisms; every axis follows the virtual master axis (position = ratio \u00d7 master + phase + cam).</text><rect id=\"svg_694da595-64a4-4956-88e2-f4553909016d\" x=\"20\" y=\"74\" width=\"1560\" height=\"66\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#202b38\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_849a84fa-e1e0-49ea-91e4-7704e9d05e4d\" x=\"40\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Master speed (rpm)</text><g id=\"HXI